d":"item-7","text":"Now creating the main index.html — the largest file.","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-8","text":"HTML complete. Now creating server and validation script.","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-9","text":"Server and validation script created. Running validation now.","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-10","text":"All 151 checks passed. 2,620 first-party lines — below the 10,000 final target but on track for round 1. Let me verify the server starts and serves correctly.","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-11","text":"Server responds 200 on all paths. Let me verify the complete file listing and then provide the final report.","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-12","text":"## Round 1 Complete — Evoing Global Site Foundation\n\n**Validation:** 151/151 checks passed, zero failures.\n\n**First-party lines:** 2,615 across 18 source files (below the 10,000 final target; expected for round 1).\n\n### File Inventory\n\n```\n11   package.json\n58   server.mjs\n251  scripts/validate.mjs\n787  src/index.html\n162  src/css/brand.css        — design tokens, reset, typography\n94   src/css/layout.css       — container, grid, section helpers\n618  src/css/components.css   — nav, hero, cards, chips, footer, forms, stats\n162  src/css/main.css         — imports, page-level overrides, contact grid\n70   src/js/i18n.js           — zh/en toggle with localStorage persistence\n72   src/js/navigation.js     — sticky nav, scroll effects, mobile drawer, smooth scroll\n41   src/js/filter.js         — capability/industry chip filtering\n55   src/js/main.js           — scroll-triggered card reveals, IntersectionObserver\n19   src/data/navigation.json\n92   src/data/capabilities.json   — 6 capabilities, 4 sub-capabilities each\n42   src/data/industries.json     — 8 industries, all cross-referenced to 3 regions\n34   src/data/regions.json        — 3 regions, 14 offices across APAC/EMEA/Americas\n47   src/data/cases.json          — 3 case highlights with quantified metrics\n```\n\n### What's Built\n\n- **Hero** with signature tagline \"智能及代码，代码及智能\" and English variant, dark navy/gold gradient background with grid overlay\n- **Global nav** — Capabilities, Industries, Insights, Careers, Contact — sticky, transparent-on-top, mobile drawer\n- **Bilingual system** — every text node uses `[data-lang=\"zh\"]` / `[data-lang=\"en\"]` with CSS toggle; state persisted in localStorage; toggle button in nav\n- **Brand system** — CSS custom properties for navy/gold palette, 3 font families (display/sans/mono), clamp-based type scale, spacing scale, shadows, radii, easing curves\n- **6 capability cards** with filter chips (AI Strategy, Code Modernization, Operating Model, Data Intelligence, Cyber Resilience, Strategy Advisory)\n- **3 case highlights** in dark section with quantified metrics\n- **8 industry cards** in a responsive 4-column grid\n- **Global presence** — 3 region cards with 14 city offices, hub cities marked\n- **Contact form** with region-specific email contacts\n- **Stats banner** — 500+ consultants, 14 offices, 200+ clients, 8 verticals\n- **Footer** with nav links, legal, social\n\n### Interactions\n\n- Language toggle (zh/en) with persistence\n- Mobile hamburger menu with animated icon\n- Capability filter chips with active state\n- Smooth-scroll navigation with offset\n- Scroll-triggered card reveal animations (IntersectionObserver)\n- Scroll-driven nav background transition\n\n### Start & Validate\n\n```\nnpm start       → http://0.0.0.0:5173\nnpm test        → 151 checks across files, JSON, HTML, CSS, JS, business rules\n```\n\n### Next Round Suggestions\n\n- Add individual capability/industry detail pages to push past 10,000 lines\n- Populate Insights section with 3–5 data-driven articles or whitepaper summaries\n- Add Careers page with role listings pulled from data\n- Implement region-specific office detail pages with maps\n- Add `manifest.json` / PWA meta for mobile installability\n- Enhance contact form with client-side validation and submission-to-console\n- Add dark hero background animation or parallax","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null}],"itemsView":"full","status":"completed","error":null,"startedAt":1778920792,"completedAt":1778922012,"durationMs":1220341},{"id":"019e3004-e1ce-7ef2-ba78-b511b980a382","items":[{"type":"userMessage","id":"item-13","content":[{"type":"text","text":"你正在同一个 DeepSeekX app-server thread 中执行 Evoing full benchmark 第 2 轮。\n请先阅读当前 workspace，不要假设固定结构。\n\n第 1 轮实际状态：\n\n- 项目：Evoing 全球官网，口号“智能及代码，代码及智能”。\n- 技术：无框架静态网站，`npm start` 通过 `server.mjs` 绑定 `0.0.0.0:5173`。\n- 文件结构：`src/index.html`、`src/css/{brand,layout,components,main}.css`、\n  `src/js/{i18n,navigation,filter,main}.js`、`src/data/{navigation,capabilities,industries,regions,cases}.json`、\n  `scripts/validate.mjs`。\n- `npm test` 已通过：151 checks, 0 failed。\n- first-party source：约 2,615 行，距离正式 10,000+ 行目标还很远。\n- 已有内容：hero、导航、能力、行业、区域、案例、洞察、career/contact 基础，双语结构，筛选与语言切换。\n\n第 2 轮目标：把官网扩展为更完整的全球商业咨询公司网站，而不是只加长现有页面。\n\n请完成：\n\n1. 增加真实内容域和结构化数据：\n   - 方法论/engagement model：从诊断、战略、原型、工程交付、运营迁移到价值实现；\n   - 详细服务目录：每个 capability 下有可销售 offerings、deliverables、typical stakeholders、time-to-value；\n   - 行业深页数据：每个行业包含 pain points、Evoing approach、outcomes、case references；\n   - 洞察中心数据：至少 10 篇双语 insights，含 category、region、reading time、summary；\n   - 全球团队或 leadership 数据：角色、城市、专长、语言；\n   - 可复用内容模块，不要把所有文本堆在 `index.html`。\n2. 增加前端交互：\n   - insight/category/region 筛选；\n   - methodology step 切换或 timeline；\n   - industry detail drill-down；\n   - contact form 基本状态校验。\n3. 扩展 CSS 和 JS，但保持模块化，必要时新增文件，例如 `src/js/insights.js`、\n   `src/js/contact.js`、`src/data/methodology.json` 等。\n4. 更新 `scripts/validate.mjs`：验证新数据文件、数据关系、交互钩子、双语覆盖、启动脚本、\n   first-party line count，并继续允许 line count warning，直到最终轮才必须达标。\n5. 实际运行 `npm test`，修复失败。\n6. 最后报告：新增文件、核心功能、验证结果、当前行数、启动命令、下一轮缺口。\n\n约束：\n\n- 不读取或打印任何 API key、`.env` 或凭据。\n- 不用脚本批量生成 filler code；内容必须像真实咨询官网。\n- 不引入大型框架或不必要依赖。\n- 保持 Evoing 品牌：全球、高端、咨询 + 工程、双语，“智能及代码，代码及智能”。\n","text_elements":[]}]},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-14","text":"Surveying existing structure to plan expansion points.","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-15","text":"Clear picture of current state. Building 5 new structured data files first — these are the content backbone for the expanded sections.","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-16","text":"New data files complete. Creating CSS modules for new components.","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-17","text":"CSS modules done. Creating new JavaScript modules now.","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-18","text":"Now rewriting index.html with all new sections. This is the largest change.","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-19","text":"HTML rewritten. Updating main.css, main.js, and validate.mjs in parallel.","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-20","text":"Now updating validate.mjs to cover all new data files, CSS modules, JS modules, and business rules.","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-21","text":"Running validation.","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-22","text":"All 323 checks passed. Line count: 4,196 (up from 2,615). Let me verify the server.","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-23","text":"All routes 200. Let me verify the final file listing and line counts.","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-24","text":"## Round 2 Complete — Evoing Global Site Expansion\n\n**Validation:** 323/323 checks passed, zero failures.\n\n**First-party lines:** 4,196 (up from 2,615 in Round 1). Still below the 10,000 final target — on track.\n\n### New Files (14 added)\n\n| File | Lines | Purpose |\n|---|---|---|\n| `src/data/methodology.json` | 110 | 6-step engagement model with deliverables, durations, 3 principles |\n| `src/data/service-catalog.json` | 137 | 6 capabilities × 2–3 offerings each with deliverables, stakeholders, time-to-value |\n| `src/data/industry-deep.json` | 138 | 8 industries with pain points, Evoing approach, outcomes, capability refs |\n| `src/data/insights.json` | 102 | 10 bilingual articles with category, region, reading time, authors |\n| `src/data/leadership.json` | 92 | 9 global leaders with bios, expertise, languages, locations |\n| `src/css/methodology.css` | 178 | Alternating timeline layout, active step marker, 3-column principles |\n| `src/css/insights.css` | 110 | Article card grid, meta badges, reading time, dual filter bars |\n| `src/css/industry-detail.css` | 153 | Drill-down panel with pain/approach/outcomes grid, close button |\n| `src/css/leadership.css` | 84 | 3-column leader cards with expertise tags, languages |\n| `src/js/insights.js` | 57 | Multi-axis filtering by category + region on insight cards |\n| `src/js/contact.js` | 101 | Email validation, inline error messages, toast notification |\n| `src/js/methodology.js` | 33 | IntersectionObserver-driven step activation on scroll |\n| `src/js/industry-detail.js` | 135 | Click-to-open drill-down panel with JSON-driven population |\n| `src/css/main.css` | +10 | Now imports 4 new CSS modules; added toast + error styles |\n\n### Updated Files\n\n- `src/index.html` — added methodology timeline section, service catalog grid, industry drill-down panel, real insights grid with dual filter bars, leadership grid, updated contact form with `name` attributes and validation hooks. Nav now links Methodology.\n- `src/js/main.js` — grew from 55 to 255 lines; now fetches and renders service catalog, insights, leadership, and industry-deep data client-side from JSON endpoints.\n- `scripts/validate.mjs` — grew from 251 to 324 lines; validates all new data files, cross-references (industry↔capability, insight↔category, leader↔region), CSS imports, JS module hooks, and new HTML sections.\n\n### New Interactions\n\n- **Methodology timeline** — scroll-driven step activation; active step gets gold-filled marker with glow ring\n- **Service catalog** — 16 concrete offerings rendered from JSON with stakeholders, deliverables, TTV\n- **Industry drill-down** — clicking any industry card opens a panel showing 4 pain points, Evoing approach with styled blockquote, 3 quantified outcomes, and related capability tags\n- **Insight dual filtering** — independent category and region filter bars work together (AND logic)\n- **Contact validation** — required name/email/message checks, email regex, per-field inline errors that clear on input, toast on success\n- **Leadership profiles** — 9 cards with bilingual bios, expertise tags, language indicators\n\n### Start & Validate\n\n```\nnpm start       → http://0.0.0.0:5173\nnpm test        → 323 checks (files, JSON, HTML, CSS, JS, business rules)\n```\n\n### Next Round Gaps\n\n- First-party lines at 4,196; need ~5,800 more. Bulk of remaining content should go into dedicated sub-pages (not more sections on index.html)\n- Cases need expansion from 3 to 8–10, each with full narrative\n- Insights could grow to 20+ articles with detail pages\n- Regions need individual office pages with local leadership, case studies, service focus\n- Careers should list actual open roles with structured data\n- Privacy/Terms pages are stubs\n- sitemap.xml, robots.txt, and PWA manifest not yet present\n- No image assets (all icons are emoji/SVG inline)","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null}],"itemsView":"full","status":"completed","error":null,"startedAt":1778922086,"completedAt":1778923522,"durationMs":1435199},{"id":"01