n` | 37 | 4 brand principles, color palette (4 swatches), typography system (3 families), 6 presentation modules, 4 downloadable assets |\n| `src/css/trust.css` | 22 | 2-col pillar cards with framework tags + commitment checklist; certification badge bar |\n| `src/css/journeys.css` | 32 | Role selector tabs, pain/journey 2-col layout, 4-step cards, success metrics banner |\n| `src/css/resources.css` | 29 | Dual filter bar, resource cards with format badges, request-access state |\n| `src/css/partners.css` | 24 | 2-col category grid, partner cards with tier + competency tags, 3-col collaboration models |\n| `src/css/brand-assets.css` | 48 | 4-col principles, color swatches with hex + usage, type samples, presentation module grid, download cards |\n| `src/js/trust.js` | 4 | Placeholder (content rendered in main.js) |\n| `src/js/journeys.js` | 21 | Role tab selector — toggles journey-content panels |\n| `src/js/resources.js` | 68 | Dual filter (format + industry) + request-access click state with toast |\n| `src/js/partners.js` | 3 | Placeholder |\n| `src/js/brand-assets.js` | 21 | Download button state toggle with toast |\n\n### New Interactions\n\n- **Trust & Governance** — 4 pillar cards showing frameworks (tag chips) and commitments (checkbox list); 6 certification badges\n- **Client Journeys** — 6 role tabs (CEO → CHRO); each shows pain points, 4-step journey cards, and success metrics\n- **Resource Library** — dual filter (format: whitepaper/playbook/briefing/webinar/assessment × industry); click \"Request Access\" toggles to \"Requested\" with toast\n- **Partner Ecosystem** — 4 category grids with 13 named partners showing tier and competency tags; 3 collaboration models\n- **Brand & Media Kit** — 4 brand principles, color swatches with hex/usage, typography specimens in actual fonts, 6-slide-count presentation modules, 4 simulated download cards\n\n### Start & Validate\n\n```\nnpm start       → http://0.0.0.0:5173\nnpm test        → 189 checks, 60 files, 20 data files, 17 CSS, 17 JS\n```\n\n### Next Round Gaps\n\n- At 5,982 lines, need ~4,000 more. The most efficient path is dedicated detail pages rather than more index.html sections\n- Individual article detail pages (12 × ~100 lines each)\n- Case study full-page narratives (8 × ~150 lines)\n- Office detail pages with local team and case studies (14 × ~80 lines)\n- Privacy Policy and Terms of Use actual content (~200 lines each)\n- `sitemap.xml` and `robots.txt`\n- PWA manifest and service worker\n- The old `src/data/cases.json` (3 lightweight entries) is now superseded by `case-studies.json` and could be removed to reduce confusion","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null}],"itemsView":"full","status":"completed","error":null,"startedAt":1778925538,"completedAt":1778926905,"durationMs":1366602}]},"model":"deepseek-v4-pro","modelProvider":"deepseek","serviceTier":null,"cwd":"/bench/20260516-163845-evoing-global-site-cache/workspace","instructionSources":[],"approvalPolicy":"never","approvalsReviewer":"user","sandbox":{"type":"dangerFullAccess"},"permissionProfile":{"type":"disabled"},"activePermissionProfile":null,"reasoningEffort":"high"}}
