":\\\"7 分钟\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"7 min\\\"},\\\"headline\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"GenAI 在中国金融业的合规落地路径\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"GenAI Compliance Pathways in Chinese Financial Services\\\"},\\\"deck\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"中国金融监管机构对生成式 AI 的态度日趋明确。本文提出符合最新监管指引的 GenAI 实施框架。\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Chinese financial regulators provide clearer guidance on generative AI. This article proposes a GenAI implementation framework.\\\"},\\\"sections\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":[\\\"监管环境分析：网信办、金监局、央行最新指引\\\",\\\"合规实施框架：模型备案、数据本地化、算法审计\\\",\\\"风控模型治理：生成式 AI 在风控中的可解释性要求\\\",\\\"典型案例：银行智能客服与投研助手的合规实践\\\"],\\\"en\\\":[\\\"Regulatory Analysis: CAC, NFRA, PBOC latest guidance\\\",\\\"Compliance Framework: Model registration, data localization, algorithm audit\\\",\\\"Risk Model Governance: Explainability requirements for GenAI in risk control\\\",\\\"Case Examples: Bank intelligent customer service and research assistant compliance\\\"]},\\\"keyTakeaways\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":[\\\"中国 GenAI 监管框架为全球最全面的之一\\\",\\\"模型备案是进入金融 GenAI 市场的必要条件\\\",\\\"人类在关键决策中必须保留最终决定权\\\"],\\\"en\\\":[\\\"China's GenAI regulatory framework is among the world's most comprehensive\\\",\\\"Model registration is mandatory for financial GenAI market entry\\\",\\\"Humans must retain final decision authority in critical decisions\\\"]},\\\"authors\\\":[{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"张伟\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Wei Zhang\\\"},{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"陈思远\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Siyuan Chen\\\"}],\\\"relatedCapabilities\\\":[\\\"ai-strategy\\\",\\\"cyber-resilience\\\"]},\n  {\\\"id\\\":\\\"art-08\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"code-modernization\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"emea\\\",\\\"date\\\":\\\"2026-02-15\\\",\\\"readingTime\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"6 分钟\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"6 min\\\"},\\\"headline\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"Green Code：软件碳效率的工程实践\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Green Code: Engineering Practices for Software Carbon Efficiency\\\"},\\\"deck\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"可持续软件工程从理论走向工程实践。我们提出了可量化的绿色编码模式及对云成本的直接影响。\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Sustainable software engineering moves from theory to practice. We propose quantifiable green coding patterns and their impact on cloud costs.\\\"},\\\"sections\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":[\\\"碳感知架构：将碳强度信号纳入调度决策\\\",\\\"能效编码模式：10 个降低 CPU/内存能耗的实践\\\",\\\"云资源优化：合理调整、Spot 实例和自动缩放\\\",\\\"测量与报告：SCI 评分与云碳足迹仪表板\\\"],\\\"en\\\":[\\\"Carbon-Aware Architecture: Integrating carbon intensity signals into scheduling\\\",\\\"Energy-Efficient Patterns: 10 practices to reduce CPU/memory energy\\\",\\\"Cloud Optimization: Rightsizing, Spot instances, and auto-scaling\\\",\\\"Measurement & Reporting: SCI scores and cloud carbon dashboards\\\"]},\\\"keyTakeaways\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":[\\\"碳感知调度可在不增加成本的情况下减排 15-30%\\\",\\\"绿色编码实践通常同时降低成本和碳排放\\\",\\\"2027 年起欧盟将要求大型企业报告 IT 碳足迹\\\"],\\\"en\\\":[\\\"Carbon-aware scheduling can reduce emissions 15-30% at no extra cost\\\",\\\"Green coding practices typically reduce both cost and carbon\\\",\\\"EU will require large enterprises to report IT carbon footprint from 2027\\\"]},\\\"authors\\\":[{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"Anna Lindström\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Anna Lindström\\\"},{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"Thomas Wright\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Thomas Wright\\\"}],\\\"relatedCapabilities\\\":[\\\"code-modernization\\\",\\\"strategy-advisory\\\"]},\n  {\\\"id\\\":\\\"art-09\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"operating-model\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"amer\\\",\\\"date\\\":\\\"2026-01-30\\\",\\\"readingTime\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"8 分钟\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"8 min\\\"},\\\"headline\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"工程师体验的四个维度：超越工具与流程\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"The Four Dimensions of Developer Experience: Beyond Tools and Processes\\\"},\\\"deck\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"DevEx 已成为技术人才竞争的关键差异化因素。我们提出覆盖工具、流程、文化与职业的四维框架。\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"DevEx has become a critical differentiator in tech talent competition. We propose a 4D framework: tools, process, culture, career.\\\"},\\\"sections\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":[\\\"工具维度：本地开发环境、CI/CD 反馈循环\\\",\\\"流程维度：代码审查、部署流程和事件响应\\\",\\\"文化维度：心理安全、学习文化和自主权\\\",\\\"职业维度：成长路径、导师制和影响力\\\"],\\\"en\\\":[\\\"Tools: Local dev environment, CI/CD feedback loops\\\",\\\"Process: Code review, deployment flow, incident response\\\",\\\"Culture: Psychological safety, learning culture, autonomy\\\",\\\"Career: Growth paths, mentorship, and impact\\\"]},\\\"keyTakeaways\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":[\\\"文化维度对工程师留任的影响最大\\\",\\\"改善反馈循环的 ROI 高于购买新工具\\\",\\\"DevEx 指标应成为工程主管的 KPI\\\"],\\\"en\\\":[\\\"Culture dimension has the largest impact on retention\\\",\\\"Improving feedback loops has higher ROI than buying new tools\\\",\\\"DevEx metrics should be engineering leaders' KPIs\\\"]},\\\"authors\\\":[{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"Emily Chen\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Emily Chen\\\"}],\\\"relatedCapabilities\\\":[\\\"operating-model\\\",\\\"code-modernization\\\"]},\n  {\\\"id\\\":\\\"art-10\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"data-intelligence\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"apac\\\",\\\"date\\\":\\\"2026-01-18\\\",\\\"readingTime\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"10 分钟\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"10 min\\\"},\\\"headline\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"实时数据管道的七大反模式\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Seven Anti-Patterns in Real-Time Data Pipelines\\\"},\\\"deck\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"基于 100+ 企业实时数据处理系统诊断，我们总结最常见的设计错误及工程化解决方案。\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Based on diagnostics of 100+ real-time data systems, we summarize the most common design mistakes and engineering solutions.\\\"},\\\"sections\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":[\\\"架构反模式：Lambda 架构的隐性成本\\\",\\\"数据质量陷阱：假设数据是干净的错误\\\",\\\"运维反模式：缺乏可观测性的流处理系统\\\",\\\"成本失控：Kafka 和 Flink 的十大省钱技巧\\\",\\\"最佳实践：经过验证的实时管道参考架构\\\"],\\\"en\\\":[\\\"Architecture Anti-Patterns: Hidden costs of Lambda architecture\\\",\\\"Data Quality Traps: The error of assuming clean data\\\",\\\"Ops Anti-Patterns: Streaming systems without observability\\\",\\\"Cost Runaway: Top 10 cost-saving tips for Kafka and Flink\\\",\\\"Best Practices: Proven reference architecture for real-time pipelines\\\"]},\\\"keyTakeaways\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":[\\\"Lambda 架构在 80% 的场景中应被 Kappa 架构取代\\\",\\\"数据质量检查应占据管道代码的 30%\\\",\\\"可观测性投资通常 6 个月内收回成本\\\"],\\\"en\\\":[\\\"Lambda architecture should be replaced by Kappa in 80% of cases\\\",\\\"Data quality checks should comprise 30% of pipeline code\\\",\\\"Observability investment typically pays back within 6 months\\\"]},\\\"authors\\\":[{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"Rajesh Menon\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Rajesh Menon\\\"},{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"黄丽华\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Lihua Huang\\\"}],\\\"relatedCapabilities\\\":[\\\"data-intelligence\\\",\\\"code-modernization\\\"]},\n  {\\\"id\\\":\\\"art-11\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"strategy-advisory\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"emea\\\",\\\"date\\\":\\\"2025-12-20\\\",\\\"readingTime\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"9 分钟\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"9 min\\\"},\\\"headline\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"技术尽调 2.0：AI 时代的并购新范式\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Tech DD 2.0: A New M&A Paradigm for the AI Era\\\"},\\\"deck\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"传统技术尽调已不足以评估 AI 公司价值。我们提出覆盖数据资产、模型质量与 AI 治理的全新框架。\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Traditional tech DD is insufficient for valuing AI companies. We propose a new framework covering data assets, model quality, and AI governance.\\\"},\\\"sections\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":[\\\"数据资产评估：数据质量、独家性与合规风险\\\",\\\"模型质量审计：准确率、偏差、可复现性\\\",\\\"AI 人才评估：团队密度与关键人物风险\\\",\\\"技术债务量化：AI 系统的隐性维护成本\\\",\\\"整合风险矩阵：文化、技术与监管的三维评估\\\"],\\\"en\\\":[\\\"Data Asset Valuation: Quality, exclusivity, and compliance risk\\\",\\\"Model Quality Audit: Accuracy, bias, reproducibility\\\",\\\"AI Talent Assessment: Team density and key person risk\\\",\\\"Technical Debt Quantification: Hidden maintenance costs of AI systems\\\",\\\"Integration Risk Matrix: 3D assessment of culture, technology, and regulation\\\"]},\\\"keyTakeaways\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":[\\\"AI 公司的真正价值在于数据 + 人才而非模型本身\\\",\\\"模型质量审计应成为 AI 并购的标准环节\\\",\\\"70% 的 AI 并购失败源于文化整合问题\\\"],\\\"en\\\":[\\\"The real value of an AI company is data + talent, not the model\\\",\\\"Model quality audit should be standard in AI M&A\\\",\\\"70% of AI M&A failures stem from cultural integration issues\\\"]},\\\"authors\\\":[{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"Sarah Mitchell\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Sarah Mitchell\\\"},{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"陈思远\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Siyuan Chen\\\"}],\\\"relatedCapabilities\\\":[\\\"strategy-advisory\\\",\\\"ai-strategy\\\"]},\n  {\\\"id\\\":\\\"art-12\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"cyber-resilience\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"apac\\\",\\\"date\\\":\\\"2025-12-05\\\",\\\"readingTime\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"7 分钟\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"7 min\\\"},\\\"headline\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"关键基础设施 OT 安全：亚太视角\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"OT Security for Critical Infrastructure: An Asia-Pacific Perspective\\\"},\\\"deck\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"亚太关键基础设施面临独特的 OT 安全挑战。本文提出基于 IEC 62443 的实用安全框架。\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Asia-Pacific critical infrastructure faces unique OT security challenges. This article proposes a practical IEC 62443-based framework.\\\"},\\\"sections\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":[\\\"OT 威胁格局：亚太地区的独特攻击面\\\",\\\"IEC 62443 实施路径：从评估到认证\\\",\\\"IT/OT 融合安全：如何在不牺牲安全的情况下互联\\\",\\\"区域合规要求：中国、日本、新加坡、澳大利亚\\\"],\\\"en\\\":[\\\"OT Threat Landscape: Unique attack surface in APAC\\\",\\\"IEC 62443 Path: From assessment to certification\\\",\\\"IT/OT Convergence: How to connect without compromising security\\\",\\\"Regional Compliance: China, Japan, Singapore, Australia\\\"]},\\\"keyTakeaways\\\":{\\\"zh\\\":[\\\"亚太 OT 攻击年增长率达 40%\\\",\\\"IEC 62443 认证可将保险费用降低 25%\\\",\\\"网络分段是最有效的第一道防线\\\"],\\\"en\\\":[\\\"APAC OT attacks growing 40% annually\\\",\\\"IEC 62443 certification can reduce insurance costs 25%\\\",\\\"Network segmentation is the most effective first line of defense\\\"]},\\\"authors\\\":[{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"David Okonkwo\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"David Okonkwo\\\"},{\\\"zh\\\":\\\"李浩然\\\",\\\"en\\\":\\\"Haoran Li\\\"}],\\\"relatedCapabilities\\\":[\\\"cyber-resilience\\\",\\\"strategy-advisory\\\"]}\n]\nENDOFFILE\"","cwd":"/bench/20260516-163845-evoing-global-site-cache/workspace","processId":"24526","source":"unifiedExecStartup","status":"completed","commandActions":[{"type":"unknown","command":"cat > /bench/20260516-163845-evoing-global-site-cache/workspace/src/data/articles.json << 'ENDOFFILE'\n[\n  {\"id\":\"art-01\",\"category\":\"ai-strategy\",\"region\":\"global\",\"date\":\"2026-05-01\",\"readingTime\":{\"zh\":\"10 分钟\",\"en\":\"10 min\"},\"headline\":{\"zh\":\"AI 代理的元年：2026 企业就绪度白皮书\",\"en\":\"Year of the AI Agent: 2026 Enterprise Readiness Whitepaper\"},\"deck\":{\"zh\":\"AI 代理从概念验证走向生产环境。我们的全球调研揭示了规模化部署的三大关键成功因素。\",\"en\":\"AI agents move from POC to production. Our global survey reveals three critical success factors for deployment at scale.\"},\"sections\":{\"zh\":[\"代理架构模式：从单任务到多代理协作\",\"安全与治理：代理权限、审计与人为干预\",\"组织就绪度：技能、流程与文化变革\",\"投资回报分析：代理 ROI 模型与基准\"],\"en\":[\"Agent Architecture: From single-task to multi-agent collaboration\",\"Security & Governance: Agent permissions, audit, and human-in-the-loop\",\"Organizational Readiness: Skills, processes, and culture change\",\"ROI Analysis: Agent ROI models and benchmarks\"]},\"keyTakeaways\":{\"zh\":[\"到 2027 年，40% 的企业将部署 AI 代理\",\"成功率最高的代理类型是内部知识检索\",\"安全治理是规模化部署的首要障碍\"],\"en\":[\"40% of enterprises will deploy AI agents by 2027\",\"Highest success rate: internal knowledge retrieval agents\",\"Security governance is the #1 barrier to scaling\"]},\"authors\":[{\"zh\":\"陈思远\",\"en\":\"Siyuan Chen\"},{\"zh\":\"James Park\",\"en\":\"James Park\"}],\"relatedCapabilities\":[\"ai-strategy\",\"cyber-resilience\"]},\n  {\"id\":\"art-02\",\"category\":\"code-modernization\",\"region\":\"amer\",\"date\":\"2026-04-22\",\"readingTime\":{\"zh\":\"8 分钟\",\"en\":\"8 min\"},\"headline\":{\"zh\":\"IDP 的新定义：从构建平台到构建平台产品\",\"en\":\"Redefining IDP: From Building a Platform to Building a Platform Product\"},\"deck\":{\"zh\":\"内部开发者平台的概念正在被重新定义。我们分析了 50+ 企业的最新平台工程实践。\",\"en\":\"The IDP concept is being redefined. We analyze the latest platform engineering practices from 50+ enterprises.\"},\"sections\":{\"zh\":[\"平台即产品：用产品思维管理内部平台\",\"开发者体验度量：DORA 之外的新维度\",\"平台团队拓扑：哪种结构适合你的组织\",\"投资回报模型：IDP 的三年总拥有成本分析\"],\"en\":[\"Platform-as-Product: Managing internal platforms with product thinking\",\"DevEx Metrics: New dimensions beyond DORA\",\"Platform Team Topologies: Which structure fits your org\",\"ROI Models: Three-year TCO analysis for IDPs\"]},\"keyTakeaways\":{\"zh\":[\"平台即产品思维使采用率从 30% 提升至 80%\",\"DevEx 指标应与业务 KPI 挂钩\",\"平台团队不应超过工程团队的 10%\"],\"en\":[\"Platform-as-product mindset lifts adoption from 30% to 80%\",\"DevEx metrics should tie to business KPIs\",\"Platform teams should not exceed 10% of engineering\"]},\"authors\":[{\"zh\":\"James Park\",\"en\":\"James Park\"},{\"zh\":\"Emily Chen\",\"en\":\"Emily Chen\"}],\"relatedCapabilities\":[\"code-modernization\",\"operating-model\"]},\n  {\"id\":\"art-03\",\"category\":\"operating-model\",\"region\":\"apac\",\"date\":\"2026-04-15\",\"readingTime\":{\"zh\":\"12 分钟\",\"en\":\"12 min\"},\"headline\":{\"zh\":\"从职能竖井到产品团队：亚洲制造业组织转型实录\",\"en\":\"From Functional Silos to Product Teams: Inside Asian Manufacturing Transformations\"},\"deck\":{\"zh\":\"基于三家中国和日本制造业巨头的真实转型数据，我们提出了产品型组织转型的五阶段框架。\",\"en\":\"Based on real transformation data from three manufacturing giants, we propose a five-stage framework for product-oriented org transformation.\"},\"sections\":{\"zh\":[\"诊断与设计：如何识别正确的产品领域边界\",\"试点团队选取：为什么前 3 个团队决定成败\",\"规模化推广：从 3 个团队到 150 个团队的路径\",\"文化转型：激励机制、绩效考核与领导力\",\"持续改进：OKR 复盘与组织健康度量\"],\"en\":[\"Diagnosis & Design: Identifying the right product domain boundaries\",\"Pilot Selection: Why the first 3 teams determine success or failure\",\"Scaling Out: From 3 to 150 teams\",\"Culture: Incentives, performance review, and leadership\",\"Continuous Improvement: OKR retrospectives and org health metrics\"]},\"keyTakeaways\":{\"zh\":[\"产品领域应以客户价值流而非技术栈划分\",\"前 90 天的变革管理至关重要\",\"领导者必须先转变自己的行为\"],\"en\":[\"Define product domains by customer value streams, not tech stacks\",\"The first 90 days of change management are critical\",\"Leaders must transform their own behavior first\"]},\"authors\":[{\"zh\":\"王敏\",\"en\":\"Min Wang\"},{\"zh\":\"佐藤健一\",\"en\":\"Kenichi Sato\"}],\"relatedCapabilities\":[\"operating-model\",\"strategy-advisory\"]},\n  {\"id\":\"art-04\",\"category\":\"data-intelligence\",\"region\":\"emea\",\"date\":\"2026-04-08\",\"readingTime\":{\"zh\":\"9 分钟\",\"en\":\"9 min\"},\"headline\":{\"zh\":\"数据网格两年回顾：承诺、陷阱与实践者指南\",\"en\":\"Data Mesh Two Years In: Promises, Pitfalls, and a Practitioner's Guide\"},\"deck\":{\"zh\":\"数据网格从热门概念走向实际落地。基于 30+ 实施项目的经验，我们复盘了什么有效、什么需要重新思考。\",\"en\":\"Data mesh moves from hype to implementation. Based on 30+ project experiences, we review what works and what needs rethinking.\"},\"sections\":{\"zh\":[\"数据产品定义：什么是好的数据产品边界\",\"联邦治理的实践：谁做什么、谁决策\",\"技术选型困境：不想被锁定但也不想碎片化\",\"组织变革：数据所有权下放的真正挑战\"],\"en\":[\"Data Product Definition: What makes a good data product boundary\",\"Federated Governance in Practice: Who does what, who decides\",\"Technology Dilemma: Avoiding lock-in without fragmentation\",\"Org Change: The real challenge of decentralizing data ownership\"]},\"keyTakeaways\":{\"zh\":[\"数据产品应以消费端需求为起点而非数据源\",\"联邦治理中最难的是建立信任而非技术\",\"70% 的数据网格项目低估了组织变革难度\"],\"en\":[\"Start data products from consumer needs, not data sources\",\"The hardest part of federated governance is trust, not technology\",\"70% of data mesh projects underestimate org change difficulty\"]},\"authors\":[{\"zh\":\"Anna Lindström\",\"en\":\"Anna Lindström\"}],\"relatedCapabilities\":[\"data-intelligence\",\"operating-model\"]},\n  {\"id\":\"art-05\",\"category\":\"cyber-resilience\",\"region\":\"global\",\"date\":\"2026-03-25\",\"readingTime\":{\"zh\":\"11 分钟\",\"en\":\"11 min\"},\"headline\":{\"zh\":\"2026 网络威胁格局：AI 攻防新战场\",\"en\":\"2026 Cyber Threat Landscape: The New AI Attack-Defense Battlefield\"},\"deck\":{\"zh\":\"AI 既是武器也是盾牌。我们分析了 2026 年最重要的五类 AI 驱动的网络威胁及对应防御策略。\",\"en\":\"AI is both weapon and shield. We analyze the five most significant AI-driven cyber threats of 2026 and defense strategies.\"},\"sections\":{\"zh\":[\"AI 驱动的社会工程：超个性化钓鱼已达工业规模\",\"深度伪造攻击：针对高管的语音和视频欺诈\",\"供应链 AI 风险：第三方 AI 模型中的后门\",\"防御性 AI 框架：从检测到自主响应\",\"2026 全球网络安全监管趋势\"],\"en\":[\"AI-Driven Social Engineering: Hyper-personalized phishing at industrial scale\",\"Deepfake Attacks: Voice and video fraud targeting executives\",\"Supply Chain AI Risk: Backdoors in third-party AI models\",\"Defensive AI: From detection to autonomous response\",\"2026 Global Cybersecurity Regulatory Trends\"]},\"keyTakeaways\":{\"zh\":[\"AI 钓鱼邮件的打开率是传统钓鱼的 3 倍\",\"防御性 AI 的投资回报率 12 个月内可达 300%\",\"零信任 + AI 检测是最有效的组合防御\"],\"en\":[\"AI phishing emails have 3x the open rate of traditional phishing\",\"Defensive AI ROI can reach 300% within 12 months\",\"Zero Trust + AI detection is the most effective combined defense\"]},\"authors\":[{\"zh\":\"David Okonkwo\",\"en\":\"David Okonkwo\"},{\"zh\":\"李浩然\",\"en\":\"Haoran Li\"}],\"relatedCapabilities\":[\"cyber-resilience\",\"ai-strategy\"]},\n  {\"id\":\"art-06\",\"category\":\"strategy-advisory\",\"region\":\"global\",\"date\":\"2026-03-12\",\"readingTime\":{\"zh\":\"15 分钟\",\"en\":\"15 min\"},\"headline\":{\"zh\":\"2026 全球技术投资展望\",\"en\":\"2026 Global Tech Investment Outlook\"},\"deck\":{\"zh\":\"年度旗舰报告：覆盖 30 个国家、12 个行业的 5,000 亿美元技术支出分析，含 AI、云、安全三年预测。\",\"en\":\"Annual flagship: USD 500B tech spending analysis across 30 countries and 12 industries with 3-year forecasts.\"},\"sections\":{\"zh\":[\"全球技术支出总览：5,000 亿美元的市场图景\",\"AI 投资趋势：从实验到规模化的转折点\",\"云基础设施：多云策略成为主流\",\"安全支出：增速首次超过整体 IT 支出\",\"区域差异：亚太增速领先全球\",\"行业基准：金融和制造业领跑 AI 投资\"],\"en\":[\"Global Tech Spending: The USD 500B landscape\",\"AI Investment: Inflection point from experiment to scale\",\"Cloud Infrastructure: Multi-cloud goes mainstream\",\"Security Spending: Growing faster than overall IT for the first time\",\"Regional Variations: APAC leads global growth\",\"Industry Benchmarks: Financial services and manufacturing lead AI\"]},\"keyTakeaways\":{\"zh\":[\"2026 年全球 AI 支出将超过 3,000 亿美元\",\"亚太区技术支出增速是全球平均的 1.5 倍\",\"安全支出首次超过传统 IT 基础设施支出\"],\"en\":[\"Global AI spending will exceed USD 300B in 2026\",\"APAC tech spending growth is 1.5x the global average\",\"Security spending surpasses traditional IT infra for the first time\"]},\"authors\":[{\"zh\":\"林小燕\",\"en\":\"Xiaoyan Lin\"},{\"zh\":\"Sarah Mitchell\",\"en\":\"Sarah Mitchell\"},{\"zh\":\"Rahul Kapoor\",\"en\":\"Rahul Kapoor\"}],\"relatedCapabilities\":[\"strategy-advisory\",\"ai-strategy\"]},\n  {\"id\":\"art-07\",\"category\":\"ai-strategy\",\"region\":\"apac\",\"date\":\"2026-02-28\",\"readingTime\":{\"zh\":\"7 分钟\",\"en\":\"7 min\"},\"headline\":{\"zh\":\"GenAI 在中国金融业的合规落地路径\",\"en\":\"GenAI Compliance Pathways in Chinese Financial Services\"},\"deck\":{\"zh\":\"中国金融监管机构对生成式 AI 的态度日趋明确。本文提出符合最新监管指引的 GenAI 实施框架。\",\"en\":\"Chinese financial regulators provide clearer guidance on generative AI. This article proposes a GenAI implementation framework.\"},\"sections\":{\"zh\":[\"监管环境分析：网信办、金监局、央行最新指引\",\"合规实施框架：模型备案、数据本地化、算法审计\",\"风控模型治理：生成式 AI 在风控中的可解释性要求\",\"典型案例：银行智能客服与投研助手的合规实践\"],\"en\":[\"Regulatory Analysis: CAC, NFRA, PBOC latest guidance\",\"Compliance Framework: Model registration, data localization, algorithm audit\",\"Risk Model Governance: Explainability requirements for GenAI in risk control\",\"Case Examples: Bank intelligent customer service and research assistant compliance\"]},\"keyTakeaways\":{\"zh\":[\"中国 GenAI 监管框架为全球最全面的之一\",\"模型备案是进入金融 GenAI 市场的必要条件\",\"人类在关键决策中必须保留最终决定权\"],\"en\":[\"China's GenAI regulatory framework is among the world's most comprehensive\",\"Model registration is mandatory for financial GenAI market entry\",\"Humans must retain final decision authority in critical decisions\"]},\"authors\":[{\"zh\":\"张伟\",\"en\":\"Wei Zhang\"},{\"zh\":\"陈思远\",\"en\":\"Siyuan Chen\"}],\"relatedCapabilities\":[\"ai-strategy\",\"cyber-resilience\"]},\n  {\"id\":\"art-08\",\"category\":\"code-modernization\",\"region\":\"emea\",\"date\":\"2026-02-15\",\"readingTime\":{\"zh\":\"6 分钟\",\"en\":\"6 min\"},\"headline\":{\"zh\":\"Green Code：软件碳效率的工程实践\",\"en\":\"Green Code: Engineering Practices for Software Carbon Efficiency\"},\"deck\":{\"zh\":\"可持续软件工程从理论走向工程实践。我们提出了可量化的绿色编码模式及对云成本的直接影响。\",\"en\":\"Sustainable software engineering moves from theory to practice. We propose quantifiable green coding patterns and their impact on cloud costs.\"},\"sections\":{\"zh\":[\"碳感知架构：将碳强度信号纳入调度决策\",\"能效编码模式：10 个降低 CPU/内存能耗的实践\",\"云资源优化：合理调整、Spot 实例和自动缩放\",\"测量与报告：SCI 评分与云碳足迹仪表板\"],\"en\":[\"Carbon-Aware Architecture: Integrating carbon intensity signals into scheduling\",\"Energy-Efficient Patterns: 10 practices to reduce CPU/memory energy\",\"Cloud Optimization: Rightsizing, Spot instances, and auto-scaling\",\"Measurement & Reporting: SCI scores and cloud carbon dashboards\"]},\"keyTakeaways\":{\"zh\":[\"碳感知调度可在不增加成本的情况下减排 15-30%\",\"绿色编码实践通常同时降低成本和碳排放\",\"2027 年起欧盟将要求大型企业报告 IT 碳足迹\"],\"en\":[\"Carbon-aware scheduling can reduce emissions 15-30% at no extra cost\",\"Green coding practices typically reduce both cost and carbon\",\"EU will require large enterprises to report IT carbon footprint from 2027\"]},\"authors\":[{\"zh\":\"Anna Lindström\",\"en\":\"Anna Lindström\"},{\"zh\":\"Thomas Wright\",\"en\":\"Thomas Wright\"}],\"relatedCapabilities\":[\"code-modernization\",\"strategy-advisory\"]},\n  {\"id\":\"art-09\",\"category\":\"operating-model\",\"region\":\"amer\",\"date\":\"2026-01-30\",\"readingTime\":{\"zh\":\"8 分钟\",\"en\":\"8 min\"},\"headline\":{\"zh\":\"工程师体验的四个维度：超越工具与流程\",\"en\":\"The Four Dimensions of Developer Experience: Beyond Tools and Processes\"},\"deck\":{\"zh\":\"DevEx 已成为技术人才竞争的关键差异化因素。我们提出覆盖工具、流程、文化与职业的四维框架。\",\"en\":\"DevEx has become a critical differentiator in tech talent competition. We propose a 4D framework: tools, process, culture, career.\"},\"sections\":{\"zh\":[\"工具维度：本地开发环境、CI/CD 反馈循环\",\"流程维度：代码审查、部署流程和事件响应\",\"文化维度：心理安全、学习文化和自主权\",\"职业维度：成长路径、导师制和影响力\"],\"en\":[\"Tools: Local dev environment, CI/CD feedback loops\",\"Process: Code review, deployment flow, incident response\",\"Culture: Psychological safety, learning culture, autonomy\",\"Career: Growth paths, mentorship, and impact\"]},\"keyTakeaways\":{\"zh\":[\"文化维度对工程师留任的影响最大\",\"改善反馈循环的 ROI 高于购买新工具\",\"DevEx 指标应成为工程主管的 KPI\"],\"en\":[\"Culture dimension has the largest impact on retention\",\"Improving feedback loops has higher ROI than buying new tools\",\"DevEx metrics should be engineering leaders' KPIs\"]},\"authors\":[{\"zh\":\"Emily Chen\",\"en\":\"Emily Chen\"}],\"relatedCapabilities\":[\"operating-model\",\"code-modernization\"]},\n  {\"id\":\"art-10\",\"category\":\"data-intelligence\",\"region\":\"apac\",\"date\":\"2026-01-18\",\"readingTime\":{\"zh\":\"10 分钟\",\"en\":\"10 min\"},\"headline\":{\"zh\":\"实时数据管道的七大反模式\",\"en\":\"Seven Anti-Patterns in Real-Time Data Pipelines\"},\"deck\":{\"zh\":\"基于 100+ 企业实时数据处理系统诊断，我们总结最常见的设计错误及工程化解决方案。\",\"en\":\"Based on diagnostics of 100+ real-time data systems, we summarize the most common design mistakes and engineering solutions.\"},\"sections\":{\"zh\":[\"架构反模式：Lambda 架构的隐性成本\",\"数据质量陷阱：假设数据是干净的错误\",\"运维反模式：缺乏可观测性的流处理系统\",\"成本失控：Kafka 和 Flink 的十大省钱技巧\",\"最佳实践：经过验证的实时管道参考架构\"],\"en\":[\"Architecture Anti-Patterns: Hidden costs of Lambda architecture\",\"Data Quality Traps: The error of assuming clean data\",\"Ops Anti-Patterns: Streaming systems without observability\",\"Cost Runaway: Top 10 cost-saving tips for Kafka and Flink\",\"Best Practices: Proven reference architecture for real-time pipelines\"]},\"keyTakeaways\":{\"zh\":[\"Lambda 架构在 80% 的场景中应被 Kappa 架构取代\",\"数据质量检查应占据管道代码的 30%\",\"可观测性投资通常 6 个月内收回成本\"],\"en\":[\"Lambda architecture should be replaced by Kappa in 80% of cases\",\"Data quality checks should comprise 30% of pipeline code\",\"Observability investment typically pays back within 6 months\"]},\"authors\":[{\"zh\":\"Rajesh Menon\",\"en\":\"Rajesh Menon\"},{\"zh\":\"黄丽华\",\"en\":\"Lihua Huang\"}],\"relatedCapabilities\":[\"data-intelligence\",\"code-modernization\"]},\n  {\"id\":\"art-11\",\"category\":\"strategy-advisory\",\"region\":\"emea\",\"date\":\"2025-12-20\",\"readingTime\":{\"zh\":\"9 分钟\",\"en\":\"9 min\"},\"headline\":{\"zh\":\"技术尽调 2.0：AI 时代的并购新范式\",\"en\":\"Tech DD 2.0: A New M&A Paradigm for the AI Era\"},\"deck\":{\"zh\":\"传统技术尽调已不足以评估 AI 公司价值。我们提出覆盖数据资产、模型质量与 AI 治理的全新框架。\",\"en\":\"Traditional tech DD is insufficient for valuing AI companies. We propose a new framework covering data assets, model quality, and AI governance.\"},\"sections\":{\"zh\":[\"数据资产评估：数据质量、独家性与合规风险\",\"模型质量审计：准确率、偏差、可复现性\",\"AI 人才评估：团队密度与关键人物风险\",\"技术债务量化：AI 系统的隐性维护成本\",\"整合风险矩阵：文化、技术与监管的三维评估\"],\"en\":[\"Data Asset Valuation: Quality, exclusivity, and compliance risk\",\"Model Quality Audit: Accuracy, bias, reproducibility\",\"AI Talent Assessment: Team density and key person risk\",\"Technical Debt Quantification: Hidden maintenance costs of AI systems\",\"Integration Risk Matrix: 3D assessment of culture, technology, and regulation\"]},\"keyTakeaways\":{\"zh\":[\"AI 公司的真正价值在于数据 + 人才而非模型本身\",\"模型质量审计应成为 AI 并购的标准环节\",\"70% 的 AI 并购失败源于文化整合问题\"],\"en\":[\"The real value of an AI company is data + talent, not the model\",\"Model quality audit should be standard in AI M&A\",\"70% of AI M&A failures stem from cultural integration issues\"]},\"authors\":[{\"zh\":\"Sarah Mitchell\",\"en\":\"Sarah Mitchell\"},{\"zh\":\"陈思远\",\"en\":\"Siyuan Chen\"}],\"relatedCapabilities\":[\"strategy-advisory\",\"ai-strategy\"]},\n  {\"id\":\"art-12\",\"category\":\"cyber-resilience\",\"region\":\"apac\",\"date\":\"2025-12-05\",\"readingTime\":{\"zh\":\"7 分钟\",\"en\":\"7 min\"},\"headline\":{\"zh\":\"关键基础设施 OT 安全：亚太视角\",\"en\":\"OT Security for Critical Infrastructure: An Asia-Pacific Perspective\"},\"deck\":{\"zh\":\"亚太关键基础设施面临独特的 OT 安全挑战。本文提出基于 IEC 62443 的实用安全框架。\",\"en\":\"Asia-Pacific critical infrastructure faces unique OT security challenges. This article proposes a practical IEC 62443-based framework.\"},\"sections\":{\"zh\":[\"OT 威胁格局：亚太地区的独特攻击面\",\"IEC 62443 实施路径：从评估到认证\",\"IT/OT 融合安全：如何在不牺牲安全的情况下互联\",\"区域合规要求：中国、日本、新加坡、澳大利亚\"],\"en\":[\"OT Threat Landscape: Unique attack surface in APAC\",\"IEC 62443 Path: From assessment to certification\",\"IT/OT Convergence: How to connect without compromising security\",\"Regional Compliance: China, Japan, Singapore, Australia\"]},\"keyTakeaways\":{\"zh\":[\"亚太 OT 攻击年增长率达 40%\",\"IEC 62443 认证可将保险费用降低 25%\",\"网络分段是最有效的第