ing: Automated detection, classification, and reporting\",\"Digital Resilience Testing: Chaos engineering as compliance tool\",\"Third-Party Risk: Engineering assessment of supplier security\"]},\"keyTakeaways\":{\"zh\":[\"DORA 合规可以且应该通过工程自动化实现\",\"混沌工程实践直接满足韧性测试要求\",\"早期投入自动化的企业合规成本降低 60%\"],\"en\":[\"DORA compliance can and should be automated through engineering\",\"Chaos engineering directly satisfies resilience testing requirements\",\"Early automation adopters reduce compliance costs by 60%\"]},\"authors\":[{\"zh\":\"Anna Lindström\",\"en\":\"Anna Lindström\"},{\"zh\":\"David Okonkwo\",\"en\":\"David Okonkwo\"}],\"relatedCapabilities\":[\"cyber-resilience\",\"code-modernization\"]},\n  {\"id\":\"art-18\",\"category\":\"strategy-advisory\",\"region\":\"amer\",\"date\":\"2025-09-10\",\"readingTime\":{\"zh\":\"7 分钟\",\"en\":\"7 min\"},\"headline\":{\"zh\":\"生成式 AI 的经济学：成本、定价与价值捕获\",\"en\":\"The Economics of Generative AI: Cost, Pricing, and Value Capture\"},\"deck\":{\"zh\":\"GenAI 的单位经济学正在快速变化。我们分析了推理成本下降趋势及其对商业模式的影响。\",\"en\":\"GenAI unit economics are changing rapidly. We analyze inference cost trends and implications for business models.\"},\"sections\":{\"zh\":[\"推理成本曲线：2024-2027 年预测\",\"从按 Token 计费到按价值计费\",\"开源模型对商业模型的颠覆\",\"企业自建 vs 使用 API 的总拥有成本比较\"],\"en\":[\"Inference Cost Curve: 2024-2027 forecast\",\"From per-token to per-value pricing\",\"Open-source disruption of commercial models\",\"Build vs Buy: TCO comparison for enterprises\"]},\"keyTakeaways\":{\"zh\":[\"推理成本每年下降 60-80%\",\"按价值计费模式将在 2027 年成为主流\",\"自建模型在年调用量超过 10 亿次时开始具有经济性\"],\"en\":[\"Inference costs dropping 60-80% annually\",\"Per-value pricing will dominate by 2027\",\"Self-hosting becomes economical above 1B annual calls\"]},\"authors\":[{\"zh\":\"林小燕\",\"en\":\"Xiaoyan Lin\"},{\"zh\":\"James Park\",\"en\":\"James Park\"}],\"relatedCapabilities\":[\"strategy-advisory\",\"ai-strategy\"]}\nENDOFFILE\n# Now we need to fix the JSON — remove trailing comma from last article and add closing bra