dology-step__summary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">转化为可执行路线图。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Translate to roadmap.</span></p><p class=\"methodology-step__duration\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">3–6 周</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">3–6 wks</span></p></div></div><div class=\"methodology-step\"><div class=\"methodology-step__marker\">3</div><div class=\"methodology-step__content\"><p class=\"methodology-step__phase\">Phase 3</p><h3 class=\"methodology-step__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">原型</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Prototype</span></h3><p class=\"methodology-step__summary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">MVP 验证关键假设。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Validate with MVP.</span></p><p class=\"methodology-step__duration\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">4–8 周</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">4–8 wks</span></p></div></div><div class=\"methodology-step\"><div class=\"methodology-step__marker\">4</div><div class=\"methodology-step__content\"><p class=\"methodology-step__phase\">Phase 4</p><h3 class=\"methodology-step__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">工程交付</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Engineer</span></h3><p class=\"methodology-step__summary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">规模化交付生产级系统。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Deliver at scale.</span></p><p class=\"methodology-step__duration\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">8–16 周</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">8–16 wks</span></p></div></div><div class=\"methodology-step\"><div class=\"methodology-step__marker\">5</div><div class=\"methodology-step__content\"><p class=\"methodology-step__phase\">Phase 5</p><h3 class=\"methodology-step__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">运营迁移</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Migrate</span></h3><p class=\"methodology-step__summary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">结构化交接确保自主运营。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Ensure independent ops.</span></p><p class=\"methodology-step__duration\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">4–8 周</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">4–8 wks</span></p></div></div><div class=\"methodology-step\"><div class=\"methodology-step__marker\">6</div><div class=\"methodology-step__content\"><p class=\"methodology-step__phase\">Phase 6</p><h3 class=\"methodology-step__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">价值实现</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Realize</span></h3><p class=\"methodology-step__summary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">持续跟踪 KPI 确保 ROI。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Track KPIs for ROI.</span></p><p class=\"methodology-step__duration\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">持续</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Ongoing</span></p></div></div></div></div></section>\n\n<!-- VALUE IMPACT CALCULATOR -->\n<section class=\"section section--dark\" id=\"value-calc\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-header\"><p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">价值影响计算器</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Value Impact Calculator</span></p><h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">选择场景，查看典型价值回报</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Select a Scenario to See Typical Value Returns</span></h2></div><div class=\"value-calc\"><div class=\"value-calc__scenarios\" id=\"value-calc-scenarios\"></div><div class=\"value-calc__panel\" id=\"value-calc-panel\"><h3 class=\"value-calc__panel-title\"></h3><div class=\"value-calc__inputs\"></div><div class=\"value-calc__outputs\"></div><p class=\"value-calc__methodology\"></p></div></div></div></section>\n\n<!-- CASE STUDIES -->\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"case-studies\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-header\"><p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">案例研究</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Case Studies</span></p><h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">交付成果，而非报告</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">We Deliver Outcomes, 