modernization\"><div class=\"card__icon\">&#x2328;</div><h3 class=\"card__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">代码现代化</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Code Modernization</span></h3><p class=\"card__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">通过平台工程、架构演进和遗留系统改造，释放软件资产的长期价值。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Unlock software asset value through platform engineering and architecture evolution.</span></p><div class=\"card__subs\"><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">平台工程</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Platform Eng</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">遗留迁移</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Legacy Migration</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">云原生</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Cloud-Native</span></span></div></article><article class=\"card\" data-category=\"operating-model\"><div class=\"card__icon\">&#x2699;</div><h3 class=\"card__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">运营模式设计</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Operating Model Design</span></h3><p class=\"card__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">重塑组织架构、流程与人才体系，使技术真正驱动业务增长。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Reshape org, process, and talent to drive business growth.</span></p><div class=\"card__subs\"><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">组织设计</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Org Design</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">敏捷运营</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Agile Ops</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">变革管理</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Change Mgmt</span></span></div></article><article class=\"card\" data-category=\"data-intelligence\"><div class=\"card__icon\">&#x1F4CA;</div><h3 class=\"card__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">数据智能</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Data Intelligence</span></h3><p class=\"card__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">