hodology-step__summary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">转化为可执行路线图。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Translate to roadmap.</span></p><p class=\"methodology-step__duration\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">3–6 周</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">3–6 wks</span></p></div></div><div class=\"methodology-step\"><div class=\"methodology-step__marker\">3</div><div class=\"methodology-step__content\"><p class=\"methodology-step__phase\">Phase 3</p><h3 class=\"methodology-step__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">原型</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Prototype</span></h3><p class=\"methodology-step__summary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">MVP 验证关键假设。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Validate with MVP.</span></p><p class=\"methodology-step__duration\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">4–8 周</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">4–8 wks</span></p></div></div><div class=\"methodology-step\"><div class=\"methodology-step__marker\">4</div><div class=\"methodology-step__content\"><p class=\"methodology-step__phase\">Phase 4</p><h3 class=\"methodology-step__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">工程交付</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Engineer</span></h3><p class=\"methodology-step__summary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">规模化交付生产级系统。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Deliver at scale.</span></p><p class=\"methodology-step__duration\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">8–16 周</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">8–16 wks</span></p></div></div><div class=\"methodology-step\"><div class=\"methodology-step__marker\">5</div><div class=\"methodology-step__content\"><p class=\"methodology-step__phase\">Phase 5</p><h3 class=\"methodology-step__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">运营迁移</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Migrate</span></h3><p class=\"methodology-step__summary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">结构化交接确保自主运营。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Ensure independent ops.</span></p><p class=\"methodology-ste