n data-lang=\"zh\">8–16 周</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">8–16 wks</span></p></div></div><div class=\"methodology-step\"><div class=\"methodology-step__marker\">5</div><div class=\"methodology-step__content\"><p class=\"methodology-step__phase\">Phase 5</p><h3 class=\"methodology-step__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">运营迁移</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Migrate</span></h3><p class=\"methodology-step__summary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">结构化交接确保自主运营。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Ensure independent ops.</span></p><p class=\"methodology-step__duration\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">4–8 周</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">4–8 wks</span></p></div></div><div class=\"methodology-step\"><div class=\"methodology-step__marker\">6</div><div class=\"methodology-step__content\"><p class=\"methodology-step__phase\">Phase 6</p><h3 class=\"methodology-step__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">价值实现</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Realize</span></h3><p class=\"methodology-step__summary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">持续跟踪 KPI 确保 ROI。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Track KPIs for ROI.</span></p><p class=\"methodology-step__duration\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">持续</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Ongoing</span></p></div></div></div></div></section>\n\n<!-- VALUE IMPACT CALCULATOR -->\n<section class=\"section section--dark\" id=\"value-calc\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-header\"><p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">价值影响计算器</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Value Impact Calculator</span></p><h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">选择场景，查看典型价值回报</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Select a Scenario to See Typical Value Returns</span></h2></div><div class=\"value-calc\"><div class=\"value-calc__scenarios\" id=\"value-calc-scenarios\"></div><div class=\"value-calc__panel\" id=\"value-calc-panel\">